@startuml
title SEQ-09 - Word Pack Selection and Safe Installation
autonumber
actor User
boundary Web
control GotIt
control Core
database DB as "product_gotit"

User -> Web: Browse packs
Web -> GotIt: GET /word-packs
GotIt -> Core: Authenticate
GotIt -> DB: Filter active catalog by profile language pair
GotIt -> DB: Aggregate installation/progress
GotIt --> Web: topics/tracks/packs
User -> Web: Open pack
Web -> GotIt: GET /word-packs/:id
GotIt -> DB: Load entries and existing links
GotIt --> Web: pack detail
User -> Web: Select 1..100 entries and Add
Web -> GotIt: POST /word-packs/:id/add\n{entryIds}
GotIt -> Core: Check vocabulary.write
critical Install pack
  GotIt -> DB: Lock user+pack and validate compatibility/version
  GotIt -> DB: Upsert active user_word_pack
  loop Selected entries
    GotIt -> DB: Find same source/language/accepted meaning
    alt Existing compatible item
      GotIt -> DB: Link and reactivate/restore when required
    else No compatible item
      GotIt -> DB: Create item + catalog translation/example + skill rows
      GotIt -> DB: Create pack-entry link
    end
  end
  GotIt -> DB: Mark unselected entries excluded
end
GotIt --> Web: added/linked/restored/excluded receipt
Web --> User: Updated pack progress and practice CTA
@enduml

